course: dictionary
lesson: 12669
title: Swollen from inside
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words are about what the body does, and doctors and science books use them. When you meet a hard word, look at the words around it. They are its context, and they give you clues. «The balloon was distended with air until it nearly burst.» A balloon that is full of air and getting bigger is being stretched. So distended must mean swollen and stretched out.
explain: The clues show you the most important part. The word tells you that something is stretched from the inside, often by gas, liquid or food. Ask yourself: what is filling it up? In a balloon it is air. In a belly it could be food, gas or water.
explain: Doctors use distended to describe a stomach or belly that is swollen. «The doctor felt the puppy's distended tummy and frowned.» A swollen belly like this can be a sign of illness or hunger, so the word is serious. It is not just a fancy way of saying big.
fact: «Distended» means swollen and stretched out from inside.
fact: Something can be distended by gas, liquid or food.
fact: «Distended» is often used about a belly or stomach, and it can be a sign of illness or hunger.
fact: «Distend» is the verb: a balloon distends when air fills it.
fact: Use the context clues first, then check the meaning by putting it in the sentence to see if it still makes sense.
exercise: «The balloon was distended with air until it nearly burst.» What does distended mean here? | Very cold and icy | *Swollen and stretched out from inside | Thin and very light | Painted in bright colours
exercise: «The starving puppy had a distended tummy and very thin legs.» What does the word tell you about the tummy? | *It is swollen, which can be a sign of hunger | It is cold to touch | It is flat and smooth
exercise: «The doctor felt his distended stomach and frowned.» Find and copy the body part that is distended. | doctor | frowned | felt | *stomach
test: «Her veins were distended after the long climb.» What does distended mean in this sentence? | *Swollen and stretched out | Smooth and flat | Hidden under her skin | Pale and cold
test: Doctors use distended to describe a stomach that is swollen. What can a distended belly be a sign of? | Good weather | A happy holiday | *Illness or hunger | Sleeping well
exam: A distended belly is one that is: | *swollen and stretched out from inside | cold and still | very thin and bony | painted or decorated
